    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ozenoxacin 1% cream (topical quinolone, FDA 2017) was discontinued in the US in September 2025 and is expensive; an alternative if mupirocin and retapamulin resistance is a concern"
     }
    ]
   }
